{"title":"Titanium Saw","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tool Smithing Lv 57)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tool Smithing at level 57 <span class=\"muted\">(3386 XP)</span> from 3× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/shagbark-wood\">Shagbark Wood</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tool-smithing\">Tool smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p><b>A tool for</b> Carpentry. Better metal and quality raise its bonus: see the skill guide’s tool box.</p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/saw\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/6d517b5446e8b565e04c.svg\" alt=\"\">Saw</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-saw\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/e53b59f1473c52a0d8a6.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Saw</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-saw\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/fcf8474f0bf96c343c4a.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Saw</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/dd129647f99f5468086c.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-wood\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/e49f7502fc376d90ea7a.svg\" alt=\"\">Shagbark Wood</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/737a960d7860f382a411.svg\" alt=\"Titanium Saw\"></div><h3>Titanium Saw</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Tool Smithing 57</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}